# Review with Greptile only

Never request, mention, or run Cursor Bugbot (`cursor[bot]`, `/review-bugbot`, `cursor review`, `bugbot run`, or the Bugbot subagent).

For pull request review, use Greptile only:
- Comment `@greptileai` on the PR
- Use the `greptile` CLI for local review (`greptile review --branch main --agent`)
